        "text": "Mutation mode starts exactly ten isolated Career Playbook generations concurrently, gives every run a unique identifier, waits for every run to reach a terminal result, and records duration, status, playbook id, cost artifact availability, and exact cleanup manifest without exposing bearer tokens.",
